<p class="wp-block-paragraph">This week in the Labs, we worked on making our Macs more comfortable, our smart-home buttons easier to remember, and our important information easier for loved ones to find. We also revisited Meditations for Mortals, with a conversation about whether all these systems are helping us spend our time well.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Below you’ll find the week’s new videos and podcasts, a few conversations happening in the member community, and what’s coming next. Most links lead into the Labs community on Circle, so they’ll only open if you’re a member. For members, this is your week at a glance. If you’re not one yet, <a href="https://www.macsparky.com/join/">it’s a peek at what you’re missing</a>.</p>



