<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our discussion of Oliver Burkeman’s book kept returning to the gap between a full calendar and a life we’re happy to be living. We talked about accepting limits, putting down books that aren’t working, and finishing things before they’re perfect. I also worked through my own tension with the book’s approach to time management.</p>



